     "score": "CVSS:3.1/AV:L/AC:L/PR:N/UI:R/S:U/C:N/I:N/A:H"
    }
   ],
   "summary": "Open Babel has NULL pointer dereference in MOL2 OBAtom::SetFormalCharge"
